# [CCAMP](../wg/ccamp.html)

## Summary

The Common Control and Measurement Plane (CCAMP) Working Group met at IETF 127. The session covered working group document status updates, AD guidance, liaison reviews, and technical presentations on optical interface parameters, microwave radio link models, optical pluggables gap analysis, CMIS access and control, performance monitoring (PM) streaming, network management agent (NMA) integration into ACTN, SLA assurance management, and fine-grain OTN (fgOTN) data models.

---

