### 2. Configurable DWDM Optical Interfaces
* **Presentation:** [01 - A YANG data model to manage configurable DWDM optical interfaces](https://datatracker.ietf.org/meeting/127/materials/slides-127-ccamp-01-a-yang-data-model-to-manage-configurable-dwdm-optical-interfaces-00)
* **Presenter:** Gabriele Galimberti
* **Draft:** `draft-ietf-ccamp-dwdm-if-param-yang`
* **Discussion:**
  * Addressed Routing Area Directorate review comments and closed all outstanding GitHub issues (including issue 27).
  * To avoid ongoing maintenance whenever new Threshold Crossing Alerts (TCAs) are introduced, the model updated `TCA type` from an `identityref` to an `instance-identifier` for both provisioning and notifications.
  * Updated Appendix D with JSON representations of TCA thresholds.
  * The authors consider the document feature-complete and ready for WGLC.

